## Coding Patterns

### Responsive Design
```javascript
// Screen size detection
const [screenSize, setScreenSize] = useState('desktop'); // 'mobile' | 'tablet' | 'desktop'

// Breakpoints
// Mobile: < 640px
// Tablet: 640-1024px
// Desktop: > 1024px

// Scaling (when needed)
const responsiveScale = screenSize === 'mobile' ? 0.5 : screenSize === 'tablet' ? 0.75 : 1;
```

### Font Sizing (Breaking News Banners)
```javascript
// Always use Math.max for minimum readable size
fontSize: `${Math.max(14, bannerHeight * 0.7)}px`

// Responsive fonts
fontFamily: screenSize === 'mobile' 
  ? "'Barlow Condensed', 'Barlow Semi Condensed', 'Roboto Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif"
  : "'Roboto Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif"

// Letter spacing on mobile for condensed text
letterSpacing: screenSize === 'mobile' ? '-0.02em' : 'normal'
```

### State Persistence
```javascript
// Use sessionId for localStorage keys
localStorage.setItem(`podcast_logo_style_${activeSessionId}`, JSON.stringify(styles));

// Retrieve with fallbacks
const savedStyles = localStorage.getItem(`podcast_logo_style_${activeSessionId}`);
const styles = savedStyles ? JSON.parse(savedStyles) : defaultStyles;
```

### Text Measurement
```javascript
// Create temp element with exact rendering styles
const measureEl = document.createElement('div');
measureEl.style.position = 'absolute';
measureEl.style.visibility = 'hidden';
measureEl.style.fontSize = `${fontSize}px`;
measureEl.style.fontFamily = /* match rendering font */;
measureEl.style.letterSpacing = /* match rendering */;
document.body.appendChild(measureEl);

// Measure, then cleanup
measureEl.textContent = testText;
const width = measureEl.offsetWidth;
document.body.removeChild(measureEl);
```

## LiveShare Graphics System

### Banner Layouts
1. **BN Layout**: Breaking News with BN.png logo extending beyond right edge
   - Logo size: `bannerHeight * 3`
   - Logo position: `right: -70px` (extends beyond screen)
   - Logo scaling: 20% smaller on mobile (0.80x)
   - Text: Full width, clips at edge

2. **Breakin Layout**: Breaking with Breakin.png logo on left
   - Logo size: `bannerHeight * 3.15`
   - Logo position: Flush left with negative margin
   - Logo adjustment: `-5%` horizontal, `-10%` vertical offset
   - Text: Full width usage

### Banner Height
- Always matches podcast logo size (no responsive scaling)
- Retrieved from `bannerState.podcastLogoSize` or default 100px
- Text padding: `logoSize + 20px` left, no right padding

### Text Splitting
- Splits at word boundaries only (no mid-word cuts)
- Re-measures on screen size change
- Cycles every 5 seconds
- Uses exact rendering font for measurement

## Media Queue & Cleanup
- Images: 10-second duration
- Videos: Full playback with progress bar, auto-advance in "Play All" mode
- Cleanup: Automatic on session end via `CleanupLiveShareAssets(sessionID)`
- Storage: `backend/uploads/liveshare/`
- Database: `liveshare_media_queue` table with CASCADE DELETE

## Testing Checklist
After any LiveShare graphics change:
- [ ] Test on mobile (< 640px) - Use Chrome DevTools or real device
- [ ] Test on tablet (640-1024px)
- [ ] Test on desktop (> 1024px)
- [ ] Verify text doesn't overflow or cut mid-word
- [ ] Check logos scale/position correctly
- [ ] Confirm minimum 14px font size maintained
- [ ] Test with long text (100+ characters)
- [ ] Verify localStorage persistence works

## Database Schema (Relevant Tables)
- `users`: User accounts with role (host/viewer)
- `rooms`: Watch rooms (instant_watch, event_based)
- `watch_sessions`: Active/ended sessions
- `liveshare_graphics`: Graphics state (banner, ticker, etc.)
- `liveshare_media_queue`: Media items with session_id
- `donations`: User tips/donations (₦2000 revenue in beta)

